<title>UK: Council of Europe mandates French franc Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe mandates French franc Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Council of Europe Social Development Fund has mandated J.P. Morgan and Societe Generale to lead manage a benchmark French franc Eurobond, a J.P. Morgan official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal will include a clause allowing for redenomination into the euro once EMU is introduced.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
